{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國球星麥巴比近日（Kylian Mbappe）疑似稱新中國開國領袖毛澤東為「中國獨裁者」，相關言論在中國引發軒然大波。</p><p>麥巴比在社交平台發表聲明，表示「向所有被我的言論所傷害的人道歉」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:42:07.162554+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:55:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:10.334921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:16.914224+00:00","content_hash":"2949d9dab100899c966f5f7940dd4641a21daa23260937764f5652c4bc9beaf0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}